Value Filldown AREA (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value Filldown LS_TYPE (.+?)
Value LINK_ID (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value ADV_ROUTER (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value AGE (\d+)
Value SEQ (0x[0-9A-Fa-f]+)
Value CKSUM (0x[0-9A-Fa-f]+)
Value LINK_COUNT (\d*)

Start
  ^\s+${LS_TYPE}\s+Link\s+States\s+\(Area\s+${AREA}\)
  ^${LINK_ID}\s+${ADV_ROUTER}\s+${AGE}\s+${SEQ}\s+${CKSUM}(\s+${LINK_COUNT})? -> Record
  ^Link\s+ID\s+ADV\s+Router
  ^OSPF\s+Router\s+with\s+ID
  ^\s*$$
  ^\.\s*$$
